//   handle = the ONE line of the cell text that is exactly "@name"; zero or two different such lines = row skipped (a display name can fake "@x").
//   Before every click the rows are read again and the row is found BY HANDLE (never by a remembered index). The confirm sheet text must contain @handle,
//   else the sheet is cancelled and the run stops ("Wrong target"). Verify = read again, the row's button no longer says "Following".
// ==PURE-BEGIN==  (decisions only: no E, no page; a Node test runs this block alone)
